ARTEX planner-only overlay for Vulnix
=====================================

The files under integrations/artex/overlay/ are an overlay for ARTEX:

  ARTEX - https://github.com/jiwoochris/artex-global (fork of the Go module
  github.com/Autumn-27/artex), licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
  License v3.0. Copyright (c) the ARTEX authors.

The overlay files are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version. They include short strings
copied from ARTEX's agent/planner.go (planner round instructions). The full
license text is at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt.

The overlay is built into an ARTEX checkout at a pinned commit and runs as a
separate program; Vulnix exchanges only JSON with it over stdin/stdout.

AGPL section 13: if you run a modified version of this program and let users
interact with it remotely over a network, you must offer those users the
Corresponding Source of that version. The overlay sources are in this
directory; ARTEX's sources are at the repository and commit named in
.github/workflows/ci.yml (job artex-real-planner).
